      "path": "docs/bestiary/Decennium_Descent_Monster_Manual_Canon_Rewrite_Source_Pack/Monster_Manual_of_the_Known_Descent_Source/entries/cave-bear.md",
      "sha256": "51616216515a4245183bf4a71cf05832a9cf7570576fac3895cb92c567e5a1c3",
      "statBlockAndTraits": "\n\n**Large Beast, Unaligned**  \n**Challenge** 2 (450 XP budget) · **Dungeon Range** T1 · **Floors** 1-10\n**Armor** 13 · **Hit Points** 68 · **Speed** 40 ft.\n\n| STR | DEX | CON | INT | WIS | CHA |\n|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| 16 (+3) | 14 (+2) | 13 (+1) | 3 (-4) | 12 (+1) | 6 (-2) |\n\n**Resistances** None  \n**Immunities** None  \n**Condition Immunities** None  \n**Tactical Vulnerability** None identified  \n**Save DC** 13  \n\n### Traits\n\n**Territorial Morale.** It may retreat or break off if food, young, or escape access is secured.\n\n### Actions\n\n**Multiattack.** The creature makes 2 attacks using the actions below.\n\n**Mauling Claws.** *Attack:* +5 to hit, one target. *Hit:* 1d10+2 slashing damage (average 8).\n\n",
      "harvest": "\n\n**Harvest skill:** Nature · **Harvest DC:** 10 · **Base time:** 30 minutes  \n\n| Component | Tier | Drop / Value |\n|---|---:|---|\n| Bear meat | 1 | 54%, 12 gp base |\n| Bear bone shard | 2 | 45%, 24 gp base |\n\n**Known recipe links:** Greater Bear Bone Shard Stew.\n\nHide, meat, bone, venom, teeth, and organs are practical resources. Damage type and preservation method determine quality.\n\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "docs/bestiary/Decennium_Descent_Monster_Manual_Canon_Rewrite_Source_Pack/Monster_Manual_of_the_Known_Descent_Source/entries/sporefolk-adult.md",
      "sha256": "99471578d5f67cfcee89e387ce8aa44b571221d9e9a4b5aedd4983fb54365791",
      "statBlockAndTraits": "\n\n**Medium Plant, Neutral**  \n**Challenge** 14 (11500 XP budget) · **Dungeon Range** T2 · **Floors** 14-15\n**Armor** 18 · **Hit Points** 348 · **Speed** 40 ft.\n\n| STR | DEX | CON | INT | WIS | CHA |\n|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| 14 (+2) | 15 (+2) | 17 (+3) | 6 (-2) | 11 (+0) | 6 (-2) |\n\n**Resistances** poison  \n**Immunities** None  \n**Condition Immunities** poisoned  \n**Tactical Vulnerability** airflow control and source-node destruction  \n**Save DC** 18  \n\n### Traits\n\n**Living Substrate.** It can use roots, spores, corpses, or standing water in its lair as the origin point of one action.\n\n### Actions\n\n**Multiattack.** The creature makes 2 attacks using the actions below.\n\n**Thorn Lash.** *Attack:* +9 to hit, one target. *Hit:* 3d8+9 piercing damage (average 22).\n\n**Entangle.** *Attack:* +9 to hit, one target. *Hit:* 3d8+8 bludgeoning damage (average 22).\n\n",
      "harvest": "\n\n**Harvest skill:** Nature · **Harvest DC:** 14 · **Base time:** 1 hour  \n\n| Component | Tier | Drop / Value |\n|---|---:|---|\n| living root | 1 | 100%, 24 gp base |\n| animated vine | 2 | 90%, 48 gp base |\n| toxic bud | 3 | 72%, 96 gp base |\n| thistle heart | 4 | 54%, 192 gp base |\n\n**Known recipe links:** Greater Living Root Cake, Minor Vital Soup, Minor Verdant Net, Refined Verdant Tackle.\n\nVenom, spores, glands, slime, hide, root fiber, and digestive acid are useful but spoil quickly and require separated containers.\n\n"
    }
